      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The presence of a 19th-century synthetic polymer is a significant and potentially deal-breaking issue for an authentic 17th-century *Rubens* piece. We must treat this as a strong indication of later intervention, potentially a repaint or inpainting rather than the original ground layer. I recommend immediately flagging the item as \"under external review for material integrity\" to manage risk before it goes into the catalog.",
